{"Date": "05/13/2026", "Record Number": "PLN2026-0122", "Record Type": "Pre-Application", "Description": "Conversion of an existing single-family residence into a duplex. Existing building area includes approximately 1,676 SF main level. The basement level, currently with approximately 5'-4\" ceiling height, will be converted into a second dwelling unit. The existing upper floor/ceiling assembly will be raised to provide approximately 9'-0\" clear ceiling height at the lower unit. Work includes demolition and replacement of the existing front entry stair and elevated rear deck with new code-compliant entry stairs and rear deck. No expansion of the building envelope is proposed. The proposed new (second) unit will contain 6 bedrooms, 6 bathrooms, and living/dining areas.", "Project Name": "ZCMH:2113 WOOLSEY STREET", "Status": "Under Review", "Action": "", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "05/13/2026", "PLN2026-0122", "Pre-Application", "Conversion of an existing single-family residence into a duplex. Existing building area includes approximately 1,676 SF main level. The basement level, currently with approximately 5'-4\" ceiling height, will be converted into a second dwelling unit. The existing upper floor/ceiling assembly will be raised to provide approximately 9'-0\" clear ceiling height at the lower unit. Work includes demolition and replacement of the existing front entry stair and elevated rear deck with new code-compliant entry stairs and rear deck. No expansion of the building envelope is proposed. The proposed new (second) unit will contain 6 bedrooms, 6 bathrooms, and living/dining areas.", "ZCMH:2113 WOOLSEY STREET", "Under Review", "", "", "", "2113 WOOLSEY St, BERKELEY CA 94705"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=DUB26&capID2=00000&capID3=00FVT&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
